---
// No props needed — copy is fixed
---

<section class="explainer">
  <p>
    Each quarter, one stock gets picked and held for 25 years. The same fixed dollar amount goes
    into the pick and into the S&amp;P 500 Total Return index on the same date. No rebalancing
    means each position is held at its original lot size. Returns include dividends reinvested.
  </p>
  <p>
    The short list of the four stocks that made serious consideration each quarter is sent to
    subscribers. The top pick is always public.
  </p>
</section>

<style>
  .explainer {
    border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
    padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
    background: var(--surface);
    border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;
  }
  .explainer p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }
  .explainer p + p {
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
  }
</style>
